      "exercise": "134",
      "prompt": "134. 完成等式$|AB|=|x_B-x_A|$的证明。",
      "figureEvidence": [],
      "grading": "ungraded",
      "source": "derived",
      "displayAnswer": "设点 $A,B$ 的坐标分别为 $x_A,x_B$。若 $x_B\\geqslant x_A$，线段长为 $x_B-x_A=|x_B-x_A|$；若 $x_B<x_A$，线段长为 $x_A-x_B=-(x_B-x_A)=|x_B-x_A|$。两点重合时两边同为 $0$。所以 $|AB|=|x_B-x_A|$。",
      "parts": [],
      "historical_entities": [],
      "notes": "Proof requires a complete reason covering both orders and coincident points; not automatically graded."
    },
